  <!-- ASOSIY XIZMATLAR VA TIBBIY MA'LUMOTLAR -->
  <main class="services-container">
    <h1 class="section-title">ESTETIK GINEKALOGIYA VA TIBBIY MUOLAJALAR</h1>
    
    <div class="sections-stack">
      
      <!-- 0. ESTETIK GINEKALOGIYA NIMA? -->
      <section class="procedure-section">
        <div class="procedure-video">
          <iframe src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/u9aQ_MEy0nU?mute=1&loop=1&playlist=u9aQ_MEy0nU" title="Estetik ginekologiya nima" frameborder="0" allow="accelerometer; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; picture-in-picture" allowfullscreen></iframe>
        </div>
        <div class="procedure-content">
          <h3>Estetik ginekologiya nima?</h3>
          <p><strong>To'liq ma'lumot:</strong> Estetik ginekologiya — ayollarning intim zonasidagi tug'ma o'zgarishlar, tug'ruqdan keyingi jarohatlar, deformatsiyalar va yosh bilan bog'liq o'zgarishlarni jarrohlik hamda zamonaviy lazersiz usullar yordamida tuzatish, tashqi ko'rinish va funksional salomatlikni to'liq tiklashga qaratilgan tibbiyotning eng ilg'or yo'nalishidir.</p>
          <p><strong>Afzalliklari:</strong> Ayollarda o'ziga bo'lgan ishonchni qaytarish, jinsiy hayot sifatini yaxshilash va intim hudud salomatligini mustahkamlashda muhim rol o'ynaydi.</p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- 1. Labioplastika -->
      <section class="procedure-section">
        <div class="procedure-video">
          <iframe src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/ttLHgzEgK-A?mute=1&loop=1&playlist=ttLHgzEgK-A" title="Labioplastika" frameborder="0" allow="accelerometer; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; picture-in-picture" allowfullscreen></iframe>
        </div>
        <div class="procedure-content">
          <h3>Labioplastika (Kichik jinsiy lablar plastikasi)</h3>
          <p><strong>Nima uchun qilinadi:</strong> Tug'ma gipertrofiya, assimetriya yoki tug'ruqdan keyingi o'zgarishlarni bartaraf etish uchun kichik jinsiy lablar hajmi va shakli korreksiya qilinadi.</p>
          <p><strong>Muolaja vaqti:</strong> 30 – 45 daqiqa (mahalliy og'riqsizlantirish ostida).</p>
          <p><strong>Tiklanish vaqti:</strong> To'liq bitish vaqti 3–4 hafta.</p>
          <p><strong>Parvarish va malhamlar:</strong> Antiseptik eritmalar bilan ishlov beriladi, shifokor tavsiya etgan <em>Levomekol</em> yoki <em>Bepanten Plus</em> malhamlari surtiladi.</p>
          <p><strong>Jinsiy aloqa cheklovi:</strong> 3–4 hafta davomida jinsiy aloqa va og'ir jismoniy mashqlar qat'iy taqiqlanadi.</p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- 2. Vaginoplastika -->
      <section class="procedure-section">
        <div class="procedure-video">
          <iframe src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/MdFuG-MtDF0?mute=1&loop=1&playlist=MdFuG-MtDF0" title="Vaginoplastika" frameborder="0" allow="accelerometer; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; picture-in-picture" allowfullscreen></iframe>
        </div>
        <div class="procedure-content">
          <h3>2. Vaginoplastika (Vagina devorlarini toraytirish)</h3>
          <p><strong>Nima uchun qilinadi:</strong> Tug'ruqdan keyingi jinsiy yo'llar kengayishini bartaraf etish, mushaklar tonusini va intim sezgirlikni to'liq tiklash.</p>
          <p><strong>Muolaja vaqti:</strong> 1 – 1.5 soat (umumiy yoki spinal og'riqsizlantirish ostida).</p>
          <p><strong>Tiklanish vaqti:</strong> To'liq tiklanish 6–8 hafta.</p>
          <p><strong>Parvarish va malhamlar:</strong> Yallig'lanishga qarshi va bitiruvchi maxsus shamchalar hamda malhamlar qo'llaniladi.</p>
          <p><strong>Jinsiy aloqa cheklovi:</strong> 2 oy (8 hafta) davomida jinsiy hayot va og'ir yuk ko'tarish taqiqlanadi.</p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- 3. Klitoroplastika -->
      <section class="procedure-section">
        <div class="procedure-video">
          <iframe src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/lQeJWYOKXEc?mute=1&loop=1&playlist=lQeJWYOKXEc" title="Klitoroplastika" frameborder="0" allow="accelerometer; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; picture-in-picture" allowfullscreen></iframe>
        </div>
        <div class="procedure-content">
          <h3>3. Klitoroplastika (Kilitra plastika)</h3>
          <p><strong>Nima uchun qilinadi:</strong> Klitor atrofidagi ortiqcha to'qimalarni olib tashlash, sezgirlikni oshirish va estetik ko'rinishni yaxshilash.</p>
          <p><strong>Muolaja vaqti:</strong> 30 – 40 daqiqa (mahalliy og'riqsizlantirish ostida).</p>
          <p><strong>Tiklanish vaqti:</strong> 3 hafta ichida to'liq tuzaladi.</p>
          <p><strong>Parvarish va malhamlar:</strong> Sovuq kompresslar qo'yiladi, antiseptik ishlov berilib, shifokor buyurgan tiklovchi malhamlar surtiladi.</p>
          <p><strong>Jinsiy aloqa cheklovi:</strong> 3–4 hafta jinsiy aloqadan saqlanish zarur.</p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- 4. Intim oqartirish -->
      <section class="procedure-section">
        <div class="procedure-video">
          <iframe src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/09W0507Oj9o?mute=1&loop=1&playlist=09W0507Oj9o" title="Intim oqartirish" frameborder="0" allow="accelerometer; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; picture-in-picture" allowfullscreen></iframe>
        </div>
        <div class="procedure-content">
          <h3>4. Intim zona pigmentatsiyasini yo'qotish (Oqartirish)</h3>
          <p><strong>Nima uchun qilinadi:</strong> Intim hududdagi terining qorayishini bartaraf etish va bir xil oq, silliq rangga keltirish.</p>
          <p><strong>Muolaja vaqti:</strong> 20 – 30 daqiqa (kursi 3–4 ta muolajadan iborat).</p>
          <p><strong>Tiklanish vaqti:</strong> Terining yangilanishi 5–7 kun davom etadi.</p>
          <p><strong>Parvarish va malhamlar:</strong> Shifokor buyurgan maxsus namlantiruvchi va oqartiruvchi kremlar surtiladi.</p>
          <p><strong>Jinsiy aloqa cheklovi:</strong> 3–5 kun jinsiy aloqadan saqlanish tavsiya etiladi.</p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- 5. Intim yoshartirish (PRP) -->
      <section class="procedure-section">
        <div class="procedure-video">
          <iframe src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/DFWFOZXZAz8?mute=1&loop=1&playlist=DFWFOZXZAz8" title="Intim yoshartirish" frameborder="0" allow="accelerometer; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; picture-in-picture" allowfullscreen></iframe>
        </div>
        <div class="procedure-content">
          <h3>5. Intim yoshartirish va Plazmoterapiya (PRP)</h3>
          <p><strong>Nima uchun qilinadi:</strong> To'qimalarni yoshartirish, qurish va qichishishni yo'qotish, sezgirlikni kuchaytirish hamda namlikni qaytarish.</p>
          <p><strong>Muolaja vaqti:</strong> 30 daqiqa (bemorning o'z qonidan plazma tayyorlab kiritiladi).</p>
          <p><strong>Tiklanish vaqti:</strong> Reabilitatsiya deyarli talab etilmaydi (1–2 kunda tiklanadi).</p>
          <p><strong>Parvarish va malhamlar:</strong> Maxsus parvarish talab qilinmaydi, shifokor tavsiyalariga amal qilinadi.</p>
          <p><strong>Jinsiy aloqa cheklovi:</strong> 2–3 kun jinsiy aloqadan saqlanish kifoya.</p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- 6. Bachadon eroziyasini davolash -->
      <section class="procedure-section">
        <div class="procedure-video">
          <iframe src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/Dg19VoPOni8?mute=1&loop=1&playlist=Dg19VoPOni8" title="Bachadon eroziyasini davolash" frameborder="0" allow="accelerometer; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; picture-in-picture" allowfullscreen></iframe>
        </div>
        <div class="procedure-content">
          <h3>6. Bachadon bo'yni eroziyasini davolash</h3>
          <p><strong>Nima uchun qilinadi:</strong> Bachadon bo'yni shilliq qavatidagi yaralanish va shikastlanishlarni lazer yoki radioto'lqin usulida davolash.</p>
          <p><strong>Muolaja vaqti:</strong> 15 – 20 daqiqa.</p>
          <p><strong>Tiklanish vaqti:</strong> To'liq bitish vaqti 3–4 hafta.</p>
          <p><strong>Parvarish va malhamlar:</strong> Shifokor buyurgan shamchalar va bitiruvchi malhamlar qo'llaniladi.</p>
          <p><strong>Jinsiy aloqa cheklovi:</strong> To'liq bitguncha (3–4 hafta) jinsiy aloqa taqiqlanadi.</p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- 7. Poliplarni olib tashlash -->
      <section class="procedure-section">
        <div class="procedure-video">
          <iframe src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/8Vw8HiHjRRM?mute=1&loop=1&playlist=8Vw8HiHjRRM" title="Polipni olish" frameborder="0" allow="accelerometer; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; picture-in-picture" allowfullscreen></iframe>
        </div>
        <div class="procedure-content">
          <h3>7. Bachadon bo'yni va devori poliplarini olish</h3>
          <p><strong>Nima uchun qilinadi:</strong> Shilliq qavatdagi ortiqcha o'smalar (poliplar) sababli yuzaga keladigan qonash va og'riqlarni bartaraf etish.</p>
          <p><strong>Muolaja vaqti:</strong> 15 – 30 daqiqa.</p>
          <p><strong>Tiklanish vaqti:</strong> 2 hafta ichida tiklanadi.</p>
          <p><strong>Parvarish va malhamlar:</strong> Antibiotik va yallig'lanishga qarshi muolajalar belgilanadi.</p>
          <p><strong>Jinsiy aloqa cheklovi:</strong> 2–3 hafta jinsiy aloqada bo'lmaslik tavsiya etiladi.</p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- 8. Implantsperal (Spiral) haqida -->
      <section class="procedure-section">
        <div class="procedure-video">
          <iframe src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/47YY7pv9il4?mute=1&loop=1&playlist=47YY7pv9il4" title="Spiral (Implantsperal)" frameborder="0" allow="accelerometer; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; picture-in-picture" allowfullscreen></iframe>
        </div>
        <div class="procedure-content">
          <h3>8. Spiral (Implantsperal - Bachadon ichi kontratseptiv vositasi)</h3>
          <p><strong>Nima uchun qilinadi:</strong> Homiladorlikning oldini olish maqsadida bachadon bo'shlig'iga malakali shifokor tomonidan maxsus spiral (misli, gormon saqlovchi) o'rnatiladi.</p>
          <p><strong>Muolaja vaqti:</strong> 5 – 10 daqiqa (hayz siklining 3-5 kunlarida qo'yilishi maqsadga muvofiq).</p>
          <p><strong>Tiklanish vaqti:</strong> O'rnatilgandan so'ng 1-2 kun ichida organizm moslashadi.</p>
          <p><strong>Parvarish va tavsiyalar:</strong> 7-10 kun davomida og'ir jismoniy yuk ko'tarish va issiq vannaga tushish taqiqlanadi. Har 6 oyda shifokor ko'rigidan o'tib turish tavsiya etiladi.</p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- 9. Sistit haqida -->
      <section class="procedure-section">
        <div class="procedure-video">
          <iframe src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/u9aQ_MEy0nU?mute=1&loop=1&playlist=u9aQ_MEy0nU" title="Sistitni davolash" frameborder="0" allow="accelerometer; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; picture-in-picture" allowfullscreen></iframe>
        </div>
        <div class="procedure-content">
          <h3>9. Sistit (Siydik pufagining yallig'lanishi)</h3>
          <p><strong>Nima uchun kelib chiqadi:</strong> Sovqotish, shaxsiy gigiyena qoidalariga rioya qilmaslik yoki infeksiyalar tushishi natijasida siydik pufagi shilliq qavatining yallig'lanishi yuzaga keladi. Tez-tez siyish, qin atrofida achishish va og'riq kuzatiladi.</p>
          <p><strong>Davolash usuli:</strong> Bakterial infeksiyaga qarshi zamonaviy antibiotikoterapiya, yallig'lanishga qarshi maxsus preparatlar, o'simlik choylari va ko'p suyuqlik ichish buyuriladi.</p>
          <p><strong>Tiklanish vaqti:</strong> To'g'ri tanlangan davolash kursi 5–7 kun ichida to'liq bartaraf etiladi.</p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- 10. Miyoma haqida -->
      <section class="procedure-section">
        <div class="procedure-video">
          <iframe src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/qfK9CE3Sdpg?mute=1&loop=1&playlist=qfK9CE3Sdpg" title="Miyoma va uni davolash" frameborder="0" allow="accelerometer; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; picture-in-picture" allowfullscreen></iframe>
        </div>
        <div class="procedure-content">
          <h3>10. Bachadon miyomasi va uni davolash</h3>
          <p><strong>Miyoma nima:</strong> Bachadon mushak qavatida hosil bo'ladigan xavfli bo'lmagan (xavfsiz) o'sma bo'lib, gormonal o'zgarishlar va nasliy omillar sabab yuzaga keladi.</p>
          <p><strong>Qanday davolanadi:</strong> Miyomaning hajmi va joylashishiga qarab zamonaviy dori-darmonlar (gormonal terapiya) yoki kichik invaziv jarrohlik yo'li bilan (konservativ miomektomiya yoki laparoskopiya) olib tashlanadi.</p>
          <p><strong>Tiklanish vaqti:</strong> Jarrohlik amaliyotidan so'ng to'liq tiklanish davri 3–4 haftani tashkil qiladi.</p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- 11. Videlina haqida -->
      <section class="procedure-section">
        <div class="procedure-video">
          <iframe src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/uXHblDt7xDQ?mute=1&loop=1&playlist=uXHblDt7xDQ" title="Vielina haqida" frameborder="0" allow="accelerometer; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; picture-in-picture" allowfullscreen></iframe>
        </div>
        <div class="procedure-content">
          <h3>11. Videlina (Intim parvarish va sog'lomlashtirish)</h3>
          <p><strong>Nima uchun qilinadi:</strong> Ayollarning intim salomatligini saqlash, mikrobiosenozni (mikroflorani) normallashtirish, qurish va noqulayliklarni bartaraf etishga qaratilgan zamonaviy tibbiy yondashuv.</p>
          <p><strong>Ta'siri:</strong> Intim hududdagi tabiiy muvozanatni tiklaydi, namlantiradi va qichishish hamda yallig'lanishlarning oldini oladi.</p>
          <p><strong>Qo'llanilishi:</strong> Shifokor tavsiya etiga ko'ra maxsus kurs sifatida belgilanadi va tezda o'z ijobiy natijasini beradi.</p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- 12. QON RANGLARI NIMANI ANGLATADI? -->
      <section class="procedure-section">
        <div class="procedure-video">
          <iframe src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/B5QA3XlrNYU?mute=1&loop=1&playlist=B5QA3XlrNYU" title="Qon ranglari nimani anglatadi" frameborder="0" allow="accelerometer; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; picture-in-picture" allowfullscreen></iframe>
        </div>
        <div class="procedure-content">
          <h3>12. Qon ranglari nimani anglatadi?</h3>
          <p><strong>Muhim tibbiy ma'lumot:</strong> Hayz yoki ajralmalar rangining o'zgarishi ayol organizmidagi gormonal holat, yallig'lanish jarayonlari yoki reproduktiv tizim salomatligi haqida muhim signal beradi.</p>
          <p><strong>Nima qilish kerak:</strong> Agar ranglarda keskin o'zgarishlar sezilsa, o'z vaqtida malakali shifokor-ginekolog ko'rigidan o'tish tavsiya etiladi.</p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- 13. Yirtilishlarni tiklash (Razriv) -->
      <section class="procedure-section">
        <div class="procedure-video">
          <iframe src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/lQeJWYOKXEc?mute=1&loop=1&playlist=lQeJWYOKXEc" title="Razrivni tiklash" frameborder="0" allow="accelerometer; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; picture-in-picture" allowfullscreen></iframe>
        </div>
        <div class="procedure-content">
          <h3>13. Tug'ruqdan keyingi yirtilishlarni tiklash (Razriv)</h3>
          <p><strong>Nima uchun qilinadi:</strong> Tug'ruq vaqtida yuzaga kelgan chandiqlar, noto'g'ri bitgan yirilishlar va deformatsiyalarni jarrohlik yo'li bilan qayta tiklash.</p>
          <p><strong>Muolaja vaqti:</strong> 45 – 60 daqiqa.</p>
          <p><strong>Tiklanish vaqti:</strong> To'liq bitish 4–6 hafta.</p>
          <p><strong>Parvarish va malhamlar:</strong> Antiseptik ishlov berish, shifokor tavsiya etgan yumshatuvchi va bitiruvchi malhamlar surtiladi.</p>
          <p><strong>Jinsiy aloqa cheklovi:</strong> 4–6 hafta davomida jinsiy aloqa qat'iy taqiqlanadi.</p>
        </div>
      </section>

    </div>
  </main>

